  <Article title="About">
    <p>We’re Bec and Jon and this is our blog to document the process of renovating our house in East London to the <a href="https://passipedia.org/certification/enerphit" target="_blank">EnerPHit standard</a> which is a relaxed version of <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Passive_house" target="_blank">Passivhaus</a> for refurbising older buildings.</p>
    <p>We’ve not done this before but think it’s important to try and make our more liveable for the hotter world we’re moving into. Plus we love a challenge and it will be interesting to try.</p>
